      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "うん。\r\nレーゲンさんは一人で\r\nこのお花を摘みにきたんだね……。",
        "official_en": "Yeah. So Raegen came here all by himself to pick one of these flowers...",
        "real_en": "Yeah.\r\nSo Raegen-san came all this way alone\r\nto pick this flower..."
