      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でもさ、もう一人のフィーナの精神世界で\r\n常闇……昔のあいつと出会ったときに思ったんだ。",
        "official_en": "But, in the other Fina’s psyche, I realized something when I met his old self while he was still Umbra.",
        "real_en": "But, in the other Fina’s psyche, I realized something when I met his old self while he was still Veritas of the Dark."
